  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida/Norge i Malawi</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida/Norway in Malawi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Genom ramavtalet med Norge kommer Sidas insatser i Malawi hanteras av Norge inom f&#xf6;ljande omr&#xe5;den: H&#xe4;lsa, HIV/Aids, Good Governance, St&#xf6;d till ekonomiska reformer. Utbetalningarna kommer inte att kunna &#xf6;ronm&#xe4;rkas till specifikt projekt - kan skapa problem i Statistikredovisningen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The agreement between Norway and Sweden in Malawi will be handled by Norway within the following 4 areas: Health, HIV/Aids, Good  Governence, Support to macroeconomic reforms. Disbursments will not be earmarked to any specific project - can create confusion when tryig to report on statistics.</narrative>
  </description>
